Package: rbsdPredict
Type: Package
Title: Predict Rice Brown Spot Disease from Climate Drivers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Alsamman", "M. Alsamman",
      email = "a.govind@cgiar.org",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: End-to-end workflows for modeling and forecasting rice brown spot
    disease (RBSD) using meteorological predictors. The package supports data
    preprocessing, hierarchical clustering of climate regimes, machine learning
    model training, cluster-wise hybrid regression, prediction, risk mapping,
    model ranking, and climate scenario simulation.
